@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-vn27-general`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Chapter II Section 2 (the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund), Articles 14
-- to 16: what the Fund is, where its money comes from, and what each insurer must pay into it,
-- by when. Article 20(2)(c), the Executive Board's recourse against a late or short payer, is
-- encoded here as the consequence of Article 16(3).
-- DECREE 220/2026 does not amend Articles 14-16 or 20: one rule answers for both vintages.

§ `Chapter II Section 2 — the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund`

-- src:453 | Mục 2
-- src:454 | CƠ CHẾ QUẢN LÝ, SỬ DỤNG QUỸ BẢO HIỂM XE CƠ GIỚI

§§ `Article 14 — principles`

-- Inert. (1) states the Fund's purposes; (2) says the insurers that deploy the compulsory motor
-- insurance contribute to it, that it is managed centrally at the Vietnam Insurance Association
-- with its own bank account; (3) requires transparent, efficient use for its purposes. None
-- decides who is paid what: Article 16 makes the contribution a duty and Article 17 says what
-- the money is for.
