@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 76(2)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the contributions for the financial year 2023 and before are governed by Article 76(2) or by earlier rules, which are not encoded in this model` MEANS
    REFUSE "the contributions for the financial year 2023 and before are governed by Article 76(2) or by earlier rules, which are not encoded in this model"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(2)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the Fund's Management Council has decided no contribution rate for the year, so the amount of Article 16(1) and (2) cannot be computed` MEANS
    REFUSE "the Fund's Management Council has decided no contribution rate for the year, so the amount of Article 16(1) and (2) cannot be computed"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(1)-(2)
GIVEN year IS AN `An insurer's contribution year`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A defect in the facts given` NUMBER
`Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` year MEANS
    IF   year's `the financial year` AT MOST 2023
    THEN `the contributions for the financial year 2023 and before are governed by Article 76(2) or by earlier rules, which are not encoded in this model`
    ELSE IF   year's `premiums collected in the preceding financial year` LESS THAN 0
         THEN LEFT `an amount is negative`
         ELSE CONSIDER year's `the rate the Council decided, in percent`
              WHEN NOTHING THEN `the Fund's Management Council has decided no contribution rate for the year, so the amount of Article 16(1) and (2) cannot be computed`
              WHEN JUST r  THEN
                  BRANCH IF r GREATER THAN 1 THEN LEFT `the Council's rate exceeds the 1% of Article 16(1)`
                         IF r LESS THAN 0    THEN LEFT `an amount is negative`
                         OTHERWISE RIGHT (year's `premiums collected in the preceding financial year` TIMES r%)

-- The Council's own deadline: before 30 April, so the last day is 29 April (fork V2).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(2); fork V2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 16(2) — the last day for the Council to decide the rate for` y MEANS
    `the last day before` (YMD y 4 30)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(2), Article 20(1)(d)
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 16(2) — the Council must decide the rate and notify it, for` y MEANS
    PARTY  `the Fund's Management Council`
    MUST   `decide the contribution rate, and notify it to the insurers and the Ministry of Finance`
    BEFORE (`Article 16(2) — the last day for the Council to decide the rate for` y)
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the Fund's Management Council`
           BECAUSE "Article 16(2): the contribution rate was not decided and notified before 30 April"

§§ `Article 16(3), with Article 20(2)(c) — paying the contribution, and the Board's recourse`

-- The insurer pays into the Fund's account: (a) before 30 June each year, 50% of the amount of
-- (1) and (2); (b) before 31 December each year, the rest. Last days 29 June and 30 December
-- (fork V2). Fork V21: "số tiền còn lại" (the remaining amount) is the amount of (1) and (2)
-- less whatever the insurer paid under (a).
-- src:485 | 3. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm triển khai bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự
-- src:486 | của chủ xe cơ giới thực hiện đóng góp vào tài khoản của Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:487 | theo thời hạn sau:
-- src:488 | a) Trước ngày 30 tháng 6 hàng năm: Nộp 50% tổng số tiền quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:489 | và khoản 2 Điều này.
-- src:490 | b) Trước ngày 31 tháng 12 hàng năm: Nộp số tiền còn lại quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:491 | và khoản 2 Điều này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(3)(a); fork V2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 16(3)(a) — the last day for the first half, in` y MEANS
    `the last day before` (YMD y 6 30)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(3)(b); fork V2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 16(3)(b) — the last day for the rest, in` y MEANS
    `the last day before` (YMD y 12 31)

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(3)(a)
GIVEN total IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 16(3)(a) — the first half of` total MEANS total TIMES 50%

-- Article 20(2)(c): the Executive Board must urge, or recover from, the insurers that do not
-- contribute on time or in the amount the rate fixes. No period is given.
-- src:649 | c) Có trách nhiệm đôn đốc hoặc thu hồi đối với các doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm
-- src:650 | không đóng góp đúng thời hạn, đúng số tiền theo tỷ lệ quy định.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 20(2)(c)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 20(2)(c) — the Executive Board must urge the insurer or recover the contribution` MEANS
    PARTY `the Fund's Executive Board`
    MUST  `urge the insurer to pay, or recover the contribution`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Fund's Executive Board`
          BECAUSE "Article 20(2)(c): the Executive Board neither urged the insurer nor recovered the contribution"

-- THE CLOCK of this rule is the date serial (`DATE_SERIAL`): a trace starts
-- `AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD …))` and stamps each payment with its date the same way.
-- A payment of at least half by 29 June, then the rest by 30 December (nothing more where the
-- first payment was the whole); a missed or short payment hands the matter to the Executive
-- Board.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 16(3), Article 20(2)(c), Article 75(11)
GIVEN y     IS A NUMBER
      total IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75`
`Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` y `, of` total MEANS
    PARTY  `the insurance enterprise`
    MUST   `pay into the Fund's account` `the first payment`
           PROVIDED `the first payment` AT LEAST `Article 16(3)(a) — the first half of` total
    BEFORE (`Article 16(3)(a) — the last day for the first half, in` y)
    HENCE  (IF   `the first payment` AT LEAST total
            THEN FULFILLED
            ELSE PARTY  `the insurance enterprise`
                 MUST   `pay into the Fund's account` `the second payment`
                        PROVIDED `the second payment` AT LEAST (total MINUS `the first payment`)
                 BEFORE (`Article 16(3)(b) — the last day for the rest, in` y)
                 HENCE  FULFILLED
                 LEST   `Article 20(2)(c) — the Executive Board must urge the insurer or recover the contribution`)
    LEST   `Article 20(2)(c) — the Executive Board must urge the insurer or recover the contribution`
